  "description": "eID Mongolia relying-party SDK for .NET (server side): RP-API client (Bearer, mTLS via HttpClient), typed errors, authentication (push / device link / QR / Web2App / App2App), signing (digest / text / linked / certificate choice), session long-poll, response validator (deterministic X.509 path builder, ACSP_V2 / RAW_DIGEST signature checks), OCSP revocation checker, PDF signature registration, organisation / person (PKI_READ) / e-Seal / USB token / share services, «My QR» and the framework-neutral login-button backend (EidLoginHandler). Native C# port of the Go and TypeScript reference SDKs; no package dependencies.",
